      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available 23rd October 2026. \n\n**When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let Letting Agents are delighted to present this stunning two-bedroom period home to the market.\n\nThis charming property is presented in turn-key condition and has been thoughtfully refurbished and maintained over the years, with a high standard of finish throughout. Currently owner-occupied, it is evident from the moment you step inside that this is a much-loved and well-cared-for home. The property immediately conveys a wonderful sense of warmth, comfort and character.\nUpon entering, you are welcomed into a cosy and inviting living room complete with a stove, which leads through to a bright, spacious and tastefully finished kitchen. The kitchen is fitted with a range of integrated appliances, providing both style and functionality. To the rear of the property is a modern, well-appointed bathroom featuring a walk-in shower.\n\nUpstairs, there are two generously proportioned bedrooms, both thoughtfully laid out and benefiting from ample wardrobe and storage space.\n\nA private rear yard completes this wonderful home, offering a practical outdoor space and further enhancing the appeal of this attractive period property.\n\nHarold Road is conveniently located in Stoneybatter, a much sought after area in Dublin 7. It is within minutes walk of Manor Street and Smithfield Square, which offer an excellent array of shops, restaurants, and cafes and is within walking distance of the city centre. It is well served by transport links with a number of bus routes offered on Manor Street and the Luas less than 10 minutes walk away. \nThere is ample parking outside the door, which is permit parking though Dublin City Council. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, charm and warmth this exceptional home has to offer.\n\nTo register your interest please email Michelle Hoare of Get Let by clicking on Email Advertiser to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a brief application with details of how many people it is for and when you wish to move home. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only. \n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324.\n"
      },
